<div class="mt-16 mb-4 md:mb-8 mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-200 ">
  <div class="mt-12 mb-20 text-center md:text-xl">
    <%= link_to new_signup_path do %>
      <div class="mt-2 inline-flex font-medium p-4 rounded-xl shadow-sm btn-primary text-xl">Start writing for free</div>
    <% end %>
    <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">Trusted by 1000+ independent bloggers</p>
  </div>

  <h2 class="source-serif font-semibold my-8 text-center text-3xl md:text-4xl tracking-tight">Independent and open source</h2>
  <p class="md:text-xl leading-relaxed my-5">
    Pagecord is bootstrapped, profitable, privacy-conscious, and <a href="https://github.com/lylo/pagecord" class="home-link">open source</a>. Take a look under the hood, suggest improvements, or host it yourself.
  </p>

  <p class="md:text-xl leading-relaxed my-12 text-center">
  Made with ❤️ and ☕️ in 🏴󠁧󠁢󠁳󠁣󠁴󠁿
  </p>
</div>
